version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-08"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - chest X-ray
  - pneumonia classification
  - PyTorch
  - Grad-CAM
abstract: >-
  A reproducible PyTorch experiment comparing centralized training with federated
  learning (FedAvg) for binary pneumonia classification on chest X-ray images,
  including non-IID client simulation, class-imbalance handling, a full evaluation
  suite, and Grad-CAM explainability.
